50
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:04,571
Bani Israil.

51
00:01:04,591 --> 00:01:06,547
Tapi pengakuan itu terlambat.

52
00:01:06,567 --> 00:01:07,734
Allah berfirman:

53
00:01:07,754 --> 00:01:09,081
